{"id":"02dbbf0106916f6e","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-conditional-equational-derivation.md","title":"条件等式与结构规则","display":"df-conditional-equational-derivation — 条件等式与结构规则","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-conditional-equational-derivation","aliases":["16-df-conditional-equational-derivation"],"display":"df-conditional-equational-derivation — 条件等式与结构规则","depends_on":["[[16-df-sigma-equation]]","[[16-df-algebraic-signature]]"],"source":"Figure3.1 pp.172–173 (PDF192–193); §3.2 pp.178–182 (PDF198–202); equivalent local rule presentation","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-conditional-equational-derivation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-conditional-equational-derivation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-conditional-equational-derivation — 条件等式与结构规则"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"714c179fab3ebb50\" href=\"?note=714c179fab3ebb50\" title=\"16-df-sigma-equation\">16-df-sigma-equation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"afcc53893d447b1b\" href=\"?note=afcc53893d447b1b\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-signature\">16-df-algebraic-signature</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Figure3.1 pp.172–173 (PDF192–193); §3.2 pp.178–182 (PDF198–202); equivalent local rule presentation"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sub}\">\\(\\mathsf{Sub}\\)</span>、替换、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\vec t)\">\\(f(\\vec t)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"afcc53893d447b1b\" href=\"?note=afcc53893d447b1b\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-signature\">16-df-algebraic-signature</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eqn}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{Eqn}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"714c179fab3ebb50\" href=\"?note=714c179fab3ebb50\" title=\"16-df-sigma-equation\">16-df-sigma-equation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\)</span> 遍历简单排序语境，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\subseteq\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma\">\\(H\\subseteq\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 为条件等式记录集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 按下文构造；所有规则实例限定在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma)\\times\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma)\\times\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 中。</li>\n<li>以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 为候选可推导序贯集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda\">\\(\\Lambda\\)</span> 为有限等式列表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\\preceq\\Lambda\">\\(\\Theta\\preceq\\Lambda\\)</span> 表示每个出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span> 的元素均出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda\">\\(\\Lambda\\)</span>；重复的出现次数不计。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\\mathbin{+\\!+}(c)\">\\(\\Theta\\mathbin{+\\!+}(c)\\)</span> 是附加一个等式的列表。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=(\\sigma,s,t)\">\\(c=(\\sigma,s,t)\\)</span> 记原子等式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;c\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;c\\rangle\\)</span> 记扁平五元记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Gamma,\\Theta,\\sigma,s,t)\">\\((\\Gamma,\\Theta,\\sigma,s,t)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 是有限序贯集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf R^c_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf R^c_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是下文定义的一步规则。集合式中出现的项和代入均限制在所列型属的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sub}\">\\(\\mathsf{Sub}\\)</span> 内。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nf(\\vec t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle1,f,\\vec t\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Atom}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\sigma,s,t)\\mid\\sigma\\in S,\\ s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;c\\rangle\\mid\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma,\\ \\Theta\\in\\mathsf{Atom}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)^{&lt;\\omega},\\ c\\in\\mathsf{Atom}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\n(\\sigma,s,t)[\\rho]&amp;\\coloneqq(\\sigma,s[\\rho],t[\\rho]),\\qquad\n\\Theta[\\rho]\\coloneqq(\\Theta_i[\\rho])_{i=1}^{|\\Theta|},\\\\\n\\Theta\\preceq\\Lambda&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{rng}(\\Theta)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\Lambda).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nf(\\vec t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle1,f,\\vec t\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Atom}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\sigma,s,t)\\mid\\sigma\\in S,\\ s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;c\\rangle\\mid\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma,\\ \\Theta\\in\\mathsf{Atom}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)^{&lt;\\omega},\\ c\\in\\mathsf{Atom}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\n(\\sigma,s,t)[\\rho]&amp;\\coloneqq(\\sigma,s[\\rho],t[\\rho]),\\qquad\n\\Theta[\\rho]\\coloneqq(\\Theta_i[\\rho])_{i=1}^{|\\Theta|},\\\\\n\\Theta\\preceq\\Lambda&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{rng}(\\Theta)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\Lambda).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf R^c_\\Sigma\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{(\\varnothing,\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;c\\rangle)\\mid c\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\Theta)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\varnothing,\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;(\\sigma,t,t)\\rangle)\\mid t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;(\\sigma,s,t)\\rangle\\},\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;(\\sigma,t,s)\\rangle)\\mid\ns,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;(\\sigma,r,s)\\rangle,\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;(\\sigma,s,t)\\rangle\\},\n\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;(\\sigma,r,t)\\rangle)\\mid r,s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;(a(f)_i,s_i,t_i)\\rangle\\mid1\\le i\\le|a(f)|\\},\n\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;(b(f),f(\\vec s),f(\\vec t))\\rangle)\\mid f\\in F,\\ \\vec s,\\vec t\\in\\mathsf{Sub}(\\Gamma,a(f))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;c\\rangle\\},\\langle\\Gamma,\\Lambda;c\\rangle)\\mid\\Theta\\preceq\\Lambda\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;c\\rangle,\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta\\mathbin{+\\!+}(c);d\\rangle\\},\n\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;d\\rangle)\\mid c,d\\in\\mathsf{Atom}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;c\\rangle\\},\\langle\\Delta,\\Theta[\\rho];c[\\rho]\\rangle)\\mid\n\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Sub}(\\Delta,\\Gamma)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf R^c_\\Sigma\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{(\\varnothing,\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;c\\rangle)\\mid c\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\Theta)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\varnothing,\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;(\\sigma,t,t)\\rangle)\\mid t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;(\\sigma,s,t)\\rangle\\},\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;(\\sigma,t,s)\\rangle)\\mid\ns,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;(\\sigma,r,s)\\rangle,\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;(\\sigma,s,t)\\rangle\\},\n\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;(\\sigma,r,t)\\rangle)\\mid r,s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;(a(f)_i,s_i,t_i)\\rangle\\mid1\\le i\\le|a(f)|\\},\n\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;(b(f),f(\\vec s),f(\\vec t))\\rangle)\\mid f\\in F,\\ \\vec s,\\vec t\\in\\mathsf{Sub}(\\Gamma,a(f))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;c\\rangle\\},\\langle\\Gamma,\\Lambda;c\\rangle)\\mid\\Theta\\preceq\\Lambda\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;c\\rangle,\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta\\mathbin{+\\!+}(c);d\\rangle\\},\n\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;d\\rangle)\\mid c,d\\in\\mathsf{Atom}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;c\\rangle\\},\\langle\\Delta,\\Theta[\\rho];c[\\rho]\\rangle)\\mid\n\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Sub}(\\Delta,\\Gamma)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nD^c_0(H)&amp;\\coloneqq H,\\\\\nD^c_{n+1}(H)&amp;\\coloneqq D^c_n(H)\\cup\\{e\\in\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma\\mid(\\exists P\\subseteq D^c_n(H))\\ (P,e)\\in\\mathsf R^c_\\Sigma\\},\\\\\nD^c_\\Sigma(H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D^c_n(H),\\\\\n\\Gamma\\mid\\Theta\\vdash_{\\Sigma,H}s=_\\sigma t&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;(\\sigma,s,t)\\rangle\\in D^c_\\Sigma(H).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nD^c_0(H)&amp;\\coloneqq H,\\\\\nD^c_{n+1}(H)&amp;\\coloneqq D^c_n(H)\\cup\\{e\\in\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma\\mid(\\exists P\\subseteq D^c_n(H))\\ (P,e)\\in\\mathsf R^c_\\Sigma\\},\\\\\nD^c_\\Sigma(H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D^c_n(H),\\\\\n\\Gamma\\mid\\Theta\\vdash_{\\Sigma,H}s=_\\sigma t&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta;(\\sigma,s,t)\\rangle\\in D^c_\\Sigma(H).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所有规则实例均取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma)\\times\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma)\\times\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 中的合法型正确记录；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\subseteq\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma\">\\(H\\subseteq\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是规格的公理集合。空前提的规则在下一层进入闭包。有限性保证每个成员有有限推导树，反向对树高归纳成立。</p>\n<p>列表成员包含关系统一实现命题的弱化、交换和收缩；所写单步 cut 与这些规则给出原书的多前提 cut。项替换涵盖类型语境的弱化、交换、收缩，但没有非法的 strengthening 规则。函数同余与原书 replacement 的等价由项结构归纳和逐参数替换给出。此处重建条件等式句法，不断言所有条件理论的范畴模型完备性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-sigma-equation","status":"resolved","id":"714c179fab3ebb50","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-sigma-equation]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-algebraic-signature","status":"resolved","id":"afcc53893d447b1b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-algebraic-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-algebraic-signature","status":"resolved","id":"afcc53893d447b1b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$、$\\mathsf{Tm}$、$\\mathsf{Sub}$、替换、$f(\\vec t)$ 采用 [[16-df-algebraic-signature]]；$\\mathrm{Eqn}_\\Sigma$ 采用 [[16-df-sigma-equation]]。$\\Gamma,\\Delta$ 遍历简单排序语境，$H\\subseteq\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma$ 为条件等式记录集合，$\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma$ 按下文构造；所有规则实例限定在 $\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma)\\times\\mathsf{CEq}_\\Sigma$ 中。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-sigma-equation","status":"resolved","id":"714c179fab3ebb50","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[